# Cloudflare Pages Alerts Runtime:
# Production & Preview use native Service Binding EMAIL_SERVICE -> dlss5-email-sender (no API token needed).
# ALERT_ADMIN_KEY is configured as a Cloudflare Pages Secret (keep local copy in gitignored .env.local).
# Optional REST API fallback (only needed if EMAIL_SERVICE binding is unavailable):
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=0055078a87a861880dc03e3eb67980a0
# CLOUDFLARE_EMAIL_API_TOKEN=
# ALERT_ADMIN_KEY=
